{"chapter": "topologies", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "021L", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0002": "$f : T \\to S$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$$\nu : (\\Sch/T)_{fppf} \\longrightarrow (\\Sch/S)_{fppf},\n\\quad\nV/T \\longmapsto V/S\n$$", "MATH_0005": "$$\nv : (\\Sch/S)_{fppf} \\longrightarrow (\\Sch/T)_{fppf},\n\\quad\n(U \\to S) \\longmapsto (U \\times_S T \\to T).\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$$\nf_{big} :\n\\Sh((\\Sch/T)_{fppf})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\Sh((\\Sch/S)_{fppf})\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$f_{big}^{-1}(\\mathcal{G})(U/T) = \\mathcal{G}(U/S)$", "MATH_0008": "$f_{big, *}(\\mathcal{F})(U/S) = \\mathcal{F}(U \\times_S T/T)$", "MATH_0009": "$f_{big}^{-1}$", "MATH_0010": "$f_{big!}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-morphism-big-fppf}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:fc6eb643838ff9e43a7c1d044e11a805e186e045a01338166f1e76f45f337c8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f336d51a2f6a44b2d3cd94044066a1768f159c0b96f0f5c6de3fe4d940fb680f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a big fppf site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism in <MATH_0003>.\nThe functor\n<MATH_0004>\nis cocontinuous, and has a continuous right adjoint\n<MATH_0005>\nThey induce the same morphism of topoi\n<MATH_0006>\nWe have <MATH_0007>.\nWe have <MATH_0008>.\nAlso, <MATH_0009> has a left adjoint <MATH_0010> which commutes with\nfibre products and equalizers.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:162838e8ce63a76c5ad309cfcb35c76c31a1a9f1b9251232455f5fbc13bb0be2", "unit_id": "tag:021W:statement"}
